IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MOONCAKE-MESH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFILL-NODES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-NODES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SLO-ATTAINMENT-X10  PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MOONCAKE.
    IF PREFILL-NODES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN < (PREFILL-NODES * 2048)
        MOVE 994 TO SLO-ATTAINMENT-X10.
    ELSE
        MOVE 942 TO SLO-ATTAINMENT-X10.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SLO-ATTAINMENT-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 PREFILL-NODES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
